ac_dec_offgrid: F33: an RC low-pass swept by decade, 2 points a decade, 1 kHz to 5 kHz (stop off the grid): VACASK stretches the grid to end on 5 kHz (1000, 2236.07, 5000), ngspice-45 stops at the last grid point below it (1000, 3162.28)
load "spice/resistor.osdi"
load "spice/capacitor.osdi"
model vsource vsource
model resistor sp_resistor
model capacitor sp_capacitor
v1 (in 0) vsource dc=1.0 mag=1.0
r1 (in out) resistor r=1k
c1 (out 0) capacitor c=1u
control
  analysis ac1 ac from=1k to=5k mode="dec" points=2
endc
